flowchart TD
    Start([Incoming HTTP Request]) --> ParseAuth[Parse Authorization header\nBasic Base64 decode]

    ParseAuth --> HasEmail{Credential format?\nemail:secret OR uuid:secret}

    HasEmail -->|email:secret| LookupByEmail[SELECT FROM users\nWHERE email = email]
    HasEmail -->|uuid:secret| LookupByUUID[SELECT FROM users\nWHERE id = UUID]
    HasEmail -->|No Authorization header| Anon[Anonymous request]

    LookupByEmail --> UserFound{User found in DB?}
    LookupByUUID --> UserFound

    UserFound -->|No| Return401[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    UserFound -->|Yes| VerifySecret{sha256 secret\n== user.secretHash?}

    VerifySecret -->|No| Return401
    VerifySecret -->|Yes| SetUser[Set user in request context]

    SetUser --> CheckAnnotation[Check @Access annotation\non route handler]

    CheckAnnotation --> RouteType{Required role?}

    RouteType -->|AUTHORITY| CheckAuthorityRole{user.roles contains AUTHORITY?}
    RouteType -->|PLATFORM| CheckPlatformRole{user.roles contains PLATFORM?}
    RouteType -->|ADMIN| CheckAdminRole{user.isAdmin OR user.roles contains ADMIN?}
    RouteType -->|GATE| CheckGateRole{user.roles contains GATE?}

    CheckAuthorityRole -->|No| Return403[Return 403 Forbidden]
    CheckAuthorityRole -->|Yes| AuthorityAccess[Set authorityId = user.roles.AUTHORITY.first\nProceed to route handler]

    CheckPlatformRole -->|No| Return403
    CheckPlatformRole -->|Yes| PlatformCount{user has exactly\n1 platform?}

    PlatformCount -->|No, multi-platform| Return401MP[Return 401: multi-platform user\ncannot send identifiers]
    PlatformCount -->|Yes| PlatformAccess[Set platformId\nProceed to route handler]

    CheckAdminRole -->|No| Return403
    CheckAdminRole -->|Yes| AdminAccess[Check write access for specific resource\nuser.checkWriteAccess\nProceed to route handler]

    CheckGateRole -->|No| Return403
    CheckGateRole -->|Yes| GateAccess[Proceed to gate route]

    Anon --> AnonymousRoute{Route allows\nanonymous access?}
    AnonymousRoute -->|Yes e.g. health check| AnonymousProceed[Proceed]
    AnonymousRoute -->|No| Return401

    AuthorityAccess --> RouteExecution([Execute route handler])
    PlatformAccess --> RouteExecution
    AdminAccess --> RouteExecution
    GateAccess --> RouteExecution
    AnonymousProceed --> RouteExecution

    style Return401 fill:#f99,stroke:#900
    style Return401MP fill:#f99,stroke:#900
    style Return403 fill:#f99,stroke:#900
    style RouteExecution fill:#9f9,stroke:#060
